@startuml
[*] --> Idle
Idle --> [*]
Idle --> HourMode : press hour button
HourMode --> MinuteMode : press minute button
MinuteMode --> AlarmHourMode : press alarm hour button
AlarmHourMode --> AlarmMinuteMode : press alarm minute button
AlarmMinuteMode --> Idle : press any other button

Idle --> IncreaseValue : press increase value button
IncreaseValue --> HourMode : press hour button
IncreaseValue --> MinuteMode : press minute button
IncreaseValue --> AlarmHourMode : press alarm hour button
IncreaseValue --> AlarmMinuteMode : press alarm minute button

AlarmFeature --> On : turn on alarm feature
On --> Off : turn off alarm feature
Off --> Idle : no action

Idle --> AlarmTriggered : set alarm time matches current time
AlarmTriggered --> AlarmRinging : trigger alarm to ring
AlarmRinging --> StopAlarm : press stop alarm button
StopAlarm --> Idle : no action

Idle --> LightFeature : press light feature button
LightFeature --> On : turn on light feature
On --> Off : turn off light feature
Off --> Idle : no action

@enduml
